{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits","id":977609,"title":"Can Angels use exploits ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-27T22:44:23-07:00","id":977609,"title":"Can Angels use exploits ?","content":"I wanted to know can angels use exploits ? <br /> <br /> I saw a few angel NPC's with embeds and I was wondering if they could use exploits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T22:51:52-07:00","id":977613,"title":"","content":"No.It's even stated in the books themselves. Exploits are basically creative use of embeds. Angels, like True Fae, have no creativity of their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T22:52:21-07:00","id":977614,"title":"","content":"According to page 158,<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> While learning to use an Embed is a matter of re-acquiring knowledge that the demon had as an angel, learning to use an Exploit is more a matter of application. Angels therefore do not use Exploits \u2014 even their more grandiose powers are perfectly in line with their missions and therefore the parameters laid down by the God-Machine. An angel that decides to emulate a demon, pushing energy through the world\u2019s mystical framework just to see what will happen, is probably on the verge of Falling. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T22:59:07-07:00","id":977616,"title":"","content":"Incepts (from the ST Guide) are basically an Angel's Exploit equivalent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T09:19:13-07:00","id":977803,"title":"","content":"Well, I would assume that they could use <i>specific</i> exploits that the G-M pre-loads into them, but figuring them out themselves is a Fall-worthy no-no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T10:23:20-07:00","id":977828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=977803#post977803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I would assume that they could use <i>specific</i> exploits that the G-M pre-loads into them, but figuring them out themselves is a Fall-worthy no-no.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> At that point, they aren't really Exploits though. They may use the mechanical representation of an exploit to cover the effect but it is really a numina, incept, manifestation or just part of their ephemeral make up. The same way Demonic Form abilities are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T11:52:49-07:00","id":977870,"title":"","content":"I don't have my book within reach but am I correct in believing that Angels get spirit numina? If so, that would offset their not being able to use Exploits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T11:55:04-07:00","id":977871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=977870#post977870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't have my book within reach but am I correct in believing that Angels get spirit numina? If so, that would offset their not being able to use Exploits.</div> </div> </div> </div>They get Numina, some of which they share with Spirits (and some which are restricted to only Angels, I think).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T05:38:35-07:00","id":978327,"title":"","content":"Can angels use Exploits? No. <br /> <br /> Can they use Numina that resemble Exploits and use similar mechanics? Absolutely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T18:24:56-07:00","id":978755,"title":"","content":"To some it up, angels can't use something called exploits, but you can totally give them the same ability, translated to run on essence and not cause compromise. but they they can't use the potato called exploits, it must be the tomato called numina.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T11:37:08-07:00","id":979172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=978755#post978755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To some it up, angels can't use something called exploits, but you can totally give them the same ability, translated to run on essence and not cause compromise. but they they can't use the potato called exploits, it must be the tomato called numina.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> To put it a little more thematically. Exploits are demons pushing the system that is the world to do things it isn't meant to do by <i>exploiting</i> flaws in the system. Almost everything an Angel does is part of the system as it is meant to work, because that's why an Angel knows how to do it. If an Angel does something not intended by the system then they are edging closer to Falling.<br /> <br /> As a further thematic point, if you give Angels an ability that is mechanically the same as an Exploit, you run the risk of de-escalating the themetic punch of an Exploit. It may dillute the idea that the Demon is breaking the system if an Angel can do the same thing within the system. Incepts include the idea that they are a special access thing that must be granted in rare cases at least partially to mitigate this (my opinion, I did not write the incepts).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T18:33:40-07:00","id":979984,"title":"","content":"Standard caveat - do what you want in your own game.<br /> <br /> As written, no, angels can't use Exploits. Sure, some Exploits may appear more powerful than an angelic equivalent in a very limited way, but that's because its effect is so limited.<br /> <br /> Exploits are what demons have managed to hack together through whatever reality access they can make. Angels get the codes and the God-Machine's blessing.<br /> <br /> If there's a specific Exploit effect you're wanting an angel to be able to achieve, I'm sure it can be replicated through numina, influences, and Incepts. (And the combinations of these will give more flexibility to the angel, allowing it to do things other than what the single Exploit allows.)<br /> <br /> But agreeing with ElvesofZion, Exploits should (generally) be better in their area of expertise. They can do things angels generally can't do, because they're hacks. They follow unexpected reality paths, and they go against routines the GM is comfortable with. Angels have the codes, but they have to follow the rules. Demons don't have that limitation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T10:19:05-07:00","id":980315,"title":"","content":"Even the terminology would seem to indicate only demons can use them. According to wikipedia &quot;<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">An </span></span></span><b>exploit</b><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (from the English verb </span></span></span><i>to exploit</i><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, meaning &quot;using something to one\u2019s own advantage&quot;) is a piece of </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software\" target=\"_blank\">software</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, a chunk of data, or a sequence of commands that takes advantage of a </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_bug\" target=\"_blank\">bug</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> or </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulnerability_(computer_science)\" target=\"_blank\">vulnerability</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> in order to cause unintended or unanticipated behavior to occur on computer software, hardware, or something electronic (usually computerized).&quot; </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T11:17:37-07:00","id":980346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=980315#post980315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even the terminology would seem to indicate only demons can use them. According to wikipedia &quot;<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">An </span></span></span><b>exploit</b><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (from the English verb </span></span></span><i>to exploit</i><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, meaning &quot;using something to one\u2019s own advantage&quot;) is a piece of </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software\" target=\"_blank\">software</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, a chunk of data, or a sequence of commands that takes advantage of a </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_bug\" target=\"_blank\">bug</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> or </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulnerability_(computer_science)\" target=\"_blank\">vulnerability</a><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> in order to cause unintended or unanticipated behavior to occur on computer software, hardware, or something electronic (usually computerized).&quot; </span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> one person's bug, is another's feature (not universally true)... and as our resident pen tester, and security expert... nothing prevents a &quot;legitimate&quot; user from using an exploit, outside of themselves. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It is correct said that law is made not for the just, but for the unjust, for the just carry the law in their hearts and do not need to call it from afar </div> </div> </div> or to be said more simply, well behaved individuals will not test your door to see if it's locked, they knock. Nothing prevents said individual from breaking a window and getting in that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T11:20:09-07:00","id":980350,"title":"","content":"Embeds and Exploits are just remembering things that demons used to be able to do as an angel, and tryign to reverse engineer how they used to do it using back doors instead of system authority. <br /> <br /> To use computer terminology, demons are hacking the system while angels are using Admin privileges to do whatever they need or want to. The end result is that, while both the demons and angels have different methods of achieving their goals, in the end its still the same trick they're pulling off. There's nothing that a demon can do that an angel can't do as well - they're both drawing from the same source of information (the God Machine). <br /> <br /> Actually, no, I lied - Interlocks are supposed to be things that the G-M can't do, but that's the extent. Everything else, including all Embeds and Exploits, is just the demons trying to replicate already existing angel abilities. So, if there's an Embed or Exploit, you can bet an angel can do it (assuming the G-M included such an ability in the angel's design).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T11:41:54-07:00","id":980360,"title":"","content":"It occurs to me, think of this in security terms, that perhaps most angels would not have access to access to &quot;exploits&quot; by virtue that they do not need that level of access, it's simply not within their job description. That doesn't mean an angel couldn't, the god machine could provision them with said ability for some reason (e.g. elimination infrastructure might need to be able to delete things that most angels can't). Perhaps worth thinking of it that way... dunno.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T15:20:33-07:00","id":980445,"title":"","content":"The reason angels can't use Exploits is that they're not entirely free-willed beings like humans. They have admin privileges, they use admin tools and pathways. Demons are hackers, they hack together working solutions. As said above, nothing stops an admin from using hacker tools - if they're human. If an angel decides to try and use an Exploit, it's exercising an element of free will which it absolutely is not designed to have. You know what happens? The Exploit probably works. Then the angel realizes that everything else has gone quiet. It no longer hears the constant data streams of the God-Machine. It no longer has admin access. It is now a demon, and that first Exploit had better have been worth it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T08:42:36-07:00","id":980787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=980346#post980346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> one person's bug, is another's feature (not universally true)... and as our resident pen tester, and security expert... nothing prevents a &quot;legitimate&quot; user from using an exploit, outside of themselves.<br /> <br /> Or to be said more simply, well behaved individuals will not test your door to see if it's locked, they knock. Nothing prevents said individual from breaking a window and getting in that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Uhhhhhh.....your metaphor kind of break down when you consider that we're talking about subordinate programs who's understanding of what is legit vs not is handed down to them as immutable laws and instructions by their creator AI. I mean, with the possible exception of Exiles the only way for an Angel to possess the Agency and freewill to do what you are talking about is to Fall and become a Demon. Otherwise if the God-Machine has said that the system is not to be used in X way then the Angel will not use it in X way BY THE VERY NATURE OF THEIR EXISTENCE. The very ability to do otherwise implicitly means that the entity is no longer an Angel as such because it violates the will of the God-Machine.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T20:50:45-07:00","id":981248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=980787#post980787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Uhhhhhh.....your metaphor kind of break down when you consider that we're talking about subordinate programs who's understanding of what is legit vs not is handed down to them as immutable laws and instructions by their creator AI. I mean, with the possible exception of Exiles the only way for an Angel to possess the Agency and freewill to do what you are talking about is to Fall and become a Demon. Otherwise if the God-Machine has said that the system is not to be used in X way then the Angel will not use it in X way BY THE VERY NATURE OF THEIR EXISTENCE. The very ability to do otherwise implicitly means that the entity is no longer an Angel as such because it violates the will of the God-Machine.</div> </div> </div> </div>unless as stated the purpose of the program is to break the rules... Metasploit is a program specifically designed for breaking into things. My point was an Angel can be designed to essentially use exploits to do its job, it's purpose might be to bypass the normal system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T04:37:02-07:00","id":981383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=981248#post981248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">unless as stated the purpose of the program is to break the rules... Metasploit is a program specifically designed for breaking into things. My point was an Angel can be designed to essentially use exploits to do its job, it's purpose might be to bypass the normal system.</div> </div> </div> </div>At which point, the angel still falls; this wouldn't be the first time the God-Machine gave contradictory information to provoke an angel to become a demon, and many are the theories that demons still hold meaning and purpose in the God-Machine's plans. Developing new abilities and techniques is well established as a potential reason for a G-M sanctioned demon-release-and-catch program.<br /> <br /> Angels simply aren't designed to operate the way you're indicating. They outright lack the self-awareness and lateral thinking capabilities that would make use of such methods. Developing such way of thinking leads directly towards the Fall. Or perhaps Exile-hood. But definietly not staying an angel. If God's plan forces an angel to become a demon for the sake of its Mission, so be it.<br /> <br /> Look at what Bunyip said above. Nothing stops a programmer from using hacker tools - if they're human. Angels are <i>not</i> human. Trying to treat them as humans is where the computer programmer analogy breaks apart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 10-04-2016, 07:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T06:59:52-07:00","id":981418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=981383#post981383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At which point, the angel still falls; this wouldn't be the first time the God-Machine gave contradictory information to provoke an angel to become a demon, and many are the theories that demons still hold meaning and purpose in the God-Machine's plans. Developing new abilities and techniques is well established as a potential reason for a G-M sanctioned demon-release-and-catch program.<br /> <br /> Angels simply aren't designed to operate the way you're indicating. They outright lack the self-awareness and lateral thinking capabilities that would make use of such methods. Developing such way of thinking leads directly towards the Fall. Or perhaps Exile-hood. But definietly not staying an angel. If God's plan forces an angel to become a demon for the sake of its Mission, so be it.<br /> <br /> Look at what Bunyip said above. Nothing stops a programmer from using hacker tools - if they're human. Angels are <i>not</i> human. Trying to treat them as humans is where the computer programmer analogy breaks apart.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> you're implying creative thinking, using something like metasploit, or sudo rm (having access to remove things other angels can't), isn't creative at all, they're tools designed with a purpose. Creative thinking would be finding an exploit without using the framework. If the mission is to destroy infrastructure that no other angel can...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T07:26:32-07:00","id":981425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=981418#post981418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> you're implying creative thinking, using something like metasploit, or sudo rm (having access to remove things other angels can't), isn't creative at all, they're tools designed with a purpose. Creative thinking would be finding an exploit without using the framework. If the mission is to destroy infrastructure that no other angel can...</div> </div> </div> </div>The God-Machine would likely use mortal agents, duped supernaturals, or corralled Cryptids. Angels are <i>expensive</i>, and Exploits are dangerous. If the Angel needs to do something, they'll get a Numina for it.<br /> <br /> No sense starting a trash fire just to water your plants using the building's sprinkler system, when you can just give them a bucket.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T07:35:05-07:00","id":981432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=981418#post981418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">you're implying creative thinking, using something like metasploit, or sudo rm (having access to remove things other angels can't), isn't creative at all, they're tools designed with a purpose. Creative thinking would be finding an exploit without using the framework. If the mission is to destroy infrastructure that no other angel can...</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm &quot;implying&quot; what's written directly in the book. Angels don't think in a way that's conductive to use of Embeds, and, by extension, Exploits. That's not how they're built. The GM uses other tool-shaped beings to study that particular effect (ie demons). Much more cost efficent that way as well.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, destroying Infrastructure has nothing to do with being able to use backdoors in the System to invoke magical abilities. Kind of drifting from the point of the comparison here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T18:01:28-07:00","id":983048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977609-can-angels-use-exploits?p=981418#post981418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> you're implying creative thinking, using something like metasploit, or sudo rm (having access to remove things other angels can't), isn't creative at all, they're tools designed with a purpose. Creative thinking would be finding an exploit without using the framework. If the mission is to destroy infrastructure that no other angel can...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But at that point they aren't Exploits, even if they are exploits. You may be taking things too literally (I'm a programmer too, I get it). Unlike an exploit, an Exploit <i>requires</i> lateral thinking to use. It is explicitly pushing beyond the system. It is hardware mods and overclocking, not just using the code as written, that's what Embeds are. Exploits requiring being outside the system, Angels aren't separate programs to the God Machine, they're sub routines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}